OL,5,G0100 Last Heroes of D-Day with Dan Snow
OL,6,     FPart one of two. Dan Snow examines
OL,7,     Fhow meticulous planning, espionage
OL,8,     Fand 3D aerial photos helped the
OL,9,     FAllied forces gain a foothold in
OL,10,     Fnorthern France in June 1944.
OL,11,G0200 Last Heroes of D-Day with Dan Snow
OL,12,     FPart two of two. Dan Snow's
OL,13,     Fdocumentary tells the powerful and
OL,14,     Fheroic stories of those who risked
OL,15,     Ftheir lives on the beaches of
OL,16,     FNormandy.
